{"id":"f7dcc9cd0025cfca","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-perfect-set.md","title":"ZFC Perfect Set","display":"df-zfc-perfect-set — ZFC Perfect Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-perfect-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-perfect-set"],"display":"df-zfc-perfect-set — ZFC Perfect Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-perfect-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-perfect-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-perfect-set — ZFC Perfect Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,P\\in V,\\quad P\\subseteq X\">\\(X,\\tau_X,P\\in V,\\quad P\\subseteq X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PerfectSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PerfectSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{PerfectSet}_S(P,X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\varnothing\\neq P\\subseteq X\\land X\\setminus P\\in\\tau_X\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau_X\\;(x\\in U\\to\\exists y\\in P\\cap U\\;(y\\neq x))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{PerfectSet}_S(P,X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\varnothing\\neq P\\subseteq X\\land X\\setminus P\\in\\tau_X\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau_X\\;(x\\in U\\to\\exists y\\in P\\cap U\\;(y\\neq x))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The binary compatibility form uses the topology designated by the space object and requires closedness plus absence of isolated points.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau_X,P\\in V,\\quad P\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PerfectSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{PerfectSet}_S(P,X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\varnothing\\neq P\\subseteq X\\land X\\setminus P\\in\\tau_X\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau_X\\;(x\\in U\\to\\exists y\\in P\\cap U\\;(y\\neq x))","display":true}],"bytes":921,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3097","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-perfect-set.md|58-df-zfc-perfect-set]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","815e63e5071e7b58"]}